criteria:
Inclusion criteria:
Aphonia or severe dysphonia, e.g., following total or partial laryngectomy (but not limited to these), and/or dysarthria;
Use of a voice prosthesis or other form of substitute voice does not preclude inclusion;
Written consent to participate in the examination;
German language proficiency: level C1 or higher
Exclusion criteria:
Current suspicion of tumor recurrence or medical complications;
Hearing impairments affecting speech production;
Acute psychiatric illness (e.g., major depression) or concerns regarding the ability to give informed consent, including dementia;
Acute or chronic dermatological conditions in the orofacial region that are not a result of tumor treatment;
Acute deterioration in general health status (performance status) due to a potentially progressive tumor disease;
Limited reading ability due to illiteracy or a native language other than German
Pronounced, non-modifiable facial hair (e.g., full sideburns);
Concurrent participation in another study
